/-!
# Table of the cosine bounds at the points `2^v 3^J / 2^17`

For `0 ≤ v ≤ 16` let `p_v = 2^{15 - v}` for `v ≤ 14` and `p_v = 2` for `v ∈ {15, 16}`, a
period of `J ↦ 2^v 3^J mod 2^17`. This file records, for `0 ≤ J < p_v + 256`, the cosine bound
`cb(2^v 3^J / 2^17)` of `U^{10^{-18}}_c`, in units of `10^{-18}` and shifted by `10^{18}`, as
lanes of width `72` of natural numbers, `256` lanes per number: lane `J mod 256` of the number
of index `⌊J / 256⌋` of level `v`.

## Main definitions

* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.cosLevels`: the packed numbers of the `17` levels.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.cosChunk`: the packed number of index `q` of level `v`.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

@[expose] public section

